  <https://w3id.org/arknet/revision/aeac89cb-ff15-4828-a50c-4759682f13fb> a <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity>,
      <https://w3id.org/arknet/provenance#Revision>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#specializationOf> <https://w3id.org/arknet/id/00b69ca0-bee6-4c60-b623-fc7268673055>;
